#   abstract_operations - Streams' abstract operations over ArrayBuffers and queues:
#   transferring a buffer, cloning a view as a Uint8Array, resetting a queue
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/Streams/AbstractOperations.cpp (lines 420-495) and the
#       ResetQueue template of AbstractOperations.h (lines 112-122), as part of the
#       ReadableStream stand-in of DESIGN.md §3.6 (region p2s). The queuing strategies, the
#       writable and transform streams' operations and cross-realm transforms are phase 4.
